From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 07:29:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] kk: MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=gpl, blend constants leave links
 alone

With MESA_KK_EXPERIMENTAL=gpl, the state a draw's link is keyed and
compiled by no longer carries the dynamic blend constants. No compile
reads them: a whole pipeline's fragment shader loads them from the root
table and a separate link's Metal blend has them set on the encoder.
Before, a draw that changed only the blend constants made, and kept, a
new Metal render pipeline for each value.

Linear: PLA-428
Class: feature
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-22-kk-gpl-cold-cache.md
Offered-upstream: not yet
---
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_gpl.c | 10 +++++++++-
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_gpl.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_gpl.c
index f1c2f80..281492d 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_gpl.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_gpl.c
@@ -285,6 +285,7 @@ struct kk_gpl_draw_state {
    struct vk_multisample_state ms;
    struct vk_render_pass_state rp;
    struct vk_multiview_state mv;
+   struct vk_color_blend_state cb;
 };
 
 static void
@@ -332,7 +333,14 @@ kk_gpl_draw_state(const struct kk_cmd_buffer *cmd,
    /* A pipeline without rasterization has no multisample state */
    st->ms = out->ms.rasterization_samples ? &out->ms : NULL;
    st->ds = &dyn->ds;
-   st->cb = &dyn->cb;
+   /* Playport (PLA-428): no compile reads the blend constants (a whole
+    * pipeline's shader loads them from the root table, a separate link's
+    * Metal blend sets them on the encoder), so a draw that changes only them
+    * keeps its link: they are left out of the state the link is keyed and
+    * compiled by. */
+   out->cb = dyn->cb;
+   memset(out->cb.blend_constants, 0, sizeof(out->cb.blend_constants));
+   st->cb = &out->cb;
    st->cal = &dyn->cal;
    st->ial = &dyn->ial;
 
